NOTE ON ARTWORK

The character portraits, pixel sprites and interior background in this
repository (png/) were produced with a generative image model and then
processed by the author. The same "view and reference only" terms above
apply to this artwork. Please check the terms of your own image provider
before using a similar generation workflow.
